K-12 Business Briefing
Five fixes for a slow bill list approval

1. Publish the bill list cutoff a week ahead.
2. Match PO, receipt and invoice before the list closes.
3. Route exceptions to one owner.
4. Use electronic approvals.
5. Track items held for missing documents.

Read the full issue on our website.

